    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353010/extras/2e7a4c1a3c172a3024759d72c541a8a7.poster.avif?t=1742186521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353010/extras/2e7a4c1a3c172a3024759d72c541a8a7.webm?t=1742186521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353010/extras/2e7a4c1a3c172a3024759d72c541a8a7.mp4?t=1742186521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Giant Creature Thrill Adventure Game</h2></strong><br>Strange Shadow is a thrill adventure game where you run and hide from scary giant creatures.<br>In the midst of traveling through space, you have crashed on this planet.<br>You must find a way home.<br>Using various actions, find a way to escape from this planet and the giant creatures lurking around you!",
